      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m more worried this is confusing.  Currently, the host command module handles received host commands, but doesn\u0027t know about specific commands.  This is putting some awfully specific code about PD and charge status and such in here.\n\nI think this code needs to go elsewhere, at the very least.",
